🔧 How Blocks are Stored in Database
Database Structure:
prismamodel PageContentBlock {
  id            BigInt   @id
  translationId BigInt   // Which page translation
  type          String   // "carousel", "cards", "stats", etc.
  data          Json     // Flexible configuration
  sortOrder     Int      // Display order
}
Example Data:
json// Carousel Block
{
  "id": 1,
  "type": "carousel",
  "sortOrder": 3,
  "data": {
    "title": "Latest News",
    "subtitle": "Check our recent updates",
    "source": "auto",  // or "manual"
    "contentType": "posts",
    "categoryFilter": null,
    "limit": 6,
    "autoplay": true,
    "autoplaySpeed": 3000,
    "itemsPerView": 3,
    "showCategory": true,
