   - YouTube/Vimeo embed
   - Or uploaded video

4. 📸 Gallery Block
   - Multiple images
   - Grid or carousel
   - Lightbox on click
Dynamic Blocks:
5. 🎴 Cards Block
   - Manual: Select specific items
   - Auto: Latest/Featured items
   - Grid layout
   - Configurable columns

6. 🔄 Carousel/Slider Block
   - Autoplay
   - Navigation arrows
   - Pagination dots
   - Configurable speed

7. 📊 Stats Block
   - Number + Icon + Label
   - Animated counters
   - Grid layout

8. 👥 Team Block
   - Team member cards
   - Photo + Name + Position
   - Bio on hover/click
