9. 🗂️ Category Cards Block
   - Show programs by category
   - Filterable
   - "View All" links

10. 📋 List Block
    - Bullet points
    - Numbered lists
    - Icon lists
    - Checkmarks

11. ❓ Accordion/FAQ Block
    - Expandable sections
    - Q&A format

