🗄️ How Database Handles It
Database Schema (Already supports this!):
prismamodel Program {
  id       Int      @id @default(autoincrement())
  parentId Int?     // ← This allows unlimited hierarchy!
  slug     String   @unique
  sortOrder Int     @default(0)
  
  parent   Program?  @relation("ProgramHierarchy", fields: [parentId])
  children Program[] @relation("ProgramHierarchy")
}
