🔄 Smart Template Selection
How System Chooses Template:
typescript// Backend logic
function getTemplateForProgram(parentId: number) {
  // 1. Get parent program
  const parent = await prisma.program.findUnique({
    where: { id: parentId }
  });
  
  // 2. Find default template for this category
  const template = await prisma.PageTemplate.findFirst({
    where: {
      categoryId: parent.id,
      isDefault: true
    }
  });
  
  // 3. If no specific template, use generic
  if (!template) {
    return await prisma.PageTemplate.findFirst({
      where: { key: 'generic_program' }
    });
  }
  
  return template;
}
```

