### **Recommended Structure:**
```
LEVEL 1: Root Categories (3-5 templates)
├─ Entrepreneurship Development → "Business Support"
├─ Tourism Development → "Tourism Program"  
├─ Export Support → "Export Program"
├─ Financial Programs → "Financial Support"
└─ Service Centers → "Service Center"

LEVEL 2: Sub-categories (Use parent template)
├─ 1.1.1 Business Universal → Inherits "Business Support" ✅
├─ 1.1.2 Tourism Development → Has own "Tourism Program" ✅
├─ 1.1.3 Credit Guarantee → Inherits "Business Support" ✅

LEVEL 3: Individual Programs (Use parent/grandparent template)
├─ 1.1.2.1 თანადაფინანსება → Inherits "Tourism Program" ✅
